:0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Path3D's toolbar and the curve property can be out of sync :\n\n![godot windows editor x86_64_rhGr1xOnlQ](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e036fa3b-e3ff-4383-8162-5ca52f833a34)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a `Path3D` node\n2. Clear the curve of its resource\n3. Notice that the toolbar is not updated as it should.\n4. Select another node in the scene tree dock, then select `Path3D` again; then add a `Curve3D` **via the inspector**\n5. Notice that the toolbar still says `Create Curve`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.